[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1082.23, "timestamp": "00:18:02", "text": "是的。嘿，马丁，抱歉，人们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1084.23, "timestamp": "00:18:04", "text": "聊天。我当时想，我应该回应一下吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1086.47, "timestamp": "00:18:06", "text": "这。我太投入了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1089.19, "timestamp": "00:18:09", "text": "就像真的一样。我不太清楚。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1091.029, "timestamp": "00:18:11", "text": "我不是那种会表现真实的人。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1093.99, "timestamp": "00:18:13", "text": "整天打字聊关于阴茎的话题。我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1095.75, "timestamp": "00:18:15", "text": "其实不是，我并不以这个闻名。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1097.909, "timestamp": "00:18:17", "text": "太真实了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1100.549, "timestamp": "00:18:20", "text": "是的，你认识这位骑师。我们傻乎乎的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1104.23, "timestamp": "00:18:24", "text": "周围很多地方。我们胡闹。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1107.99, "timestamp": "00:18:27", "text": "我们现在不会那么感伤了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1109.75, "timestamp": "00:18:29", "text": "嘿，爸爸。是的。我们其实并不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1111.27, "timestamp": "00:18:31", "text": "玩任何游戏。我们只是我们只是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1112.63, "timestamp": "00:18:32", "text": "感觉很棒。我们正在交谈。我们只是一个"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1114.237, "timestamp": "00:18:34", "author": "@LeverBoi", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xNxuxXmHi1c7fysDq7xCqQFkIHS14-WZ-pDk_WA0vJh_7H6RdN1zGFsbYrCE6izTRTxqZPdBqA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "it's not bad lol"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1114.789, "timestamp": "00:18:34", "text": "一群好兄弟。我们只是一群"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1116.47, "timestamp": "00:18:36", "text": "兄弟们喝水，然后就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1119.83, "timestamp": "00:18:39", "text": "对外发言。是的。每当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1122.63, "timestamp": "00:18:42", "text": "我们就是会做这种事，就像我们兄弟俩一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1124.39, "timestamp": "00:18:44", "text": "感觉很棒，我总觉得我们就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1127.51, "timestamp": "00:18:47", "text": "户外山坡上，也许像一片草地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1129.99, "timestamp": "00:18:49", "text": "山坡上，我们俩感觉很放松，彼此都很享受这种氛围。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1132.71, "timestamp": "00:18:52", "text": "只是看看天空，聊聊天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1135.27, "timestamp": "00:18:55", "text": "我就是这样看待这些的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1137.51, "timestamp": "00:18:57", "text": "我们之间的氛围谈话不仅仅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1139.27, "timestamp": "00:18:59", "text": "当你和其他人一起的时候，我们只是"}]